calibration certificates on file and current for every torque wrench mobilizing, with each wrench entered in the controlled wrench register.","source":"derived","state":"met","detail":"All 3 registered wrenches hold a calibration valid on 2026-04-06."},{"id":"g0.expected_by","gate":"G0","text":"Section expected by dates set against the construction schedule.","source":"derived","state":"met","detail":"All 20 applicable sections carry an expected-by date."},{"id":"g0.planned_curve","gate":"G0","text":"Planned completion curve agreed and recorded.","source":"derived","state":"met","detail":"Curve agreed 2026-03-31, 6 milestones."}]', 52.74, null, null),
  ('d0d0d0d0-0f52-fedb-b863-1518e5b79829', 'd0d0d0d0-11c4-9d67-0910-4f8296208107', 'G1', 1, 'conditional_pass', 'd0d0d0d0-3d06-5afb-2e08-226c18716b69', 'd0d0d0d0-3c78-d035-c5f5-a6ba1b49cce7', null, '2026-09-18T17:00:00Z', '[{"id":"g1.curve","gate":"G1","text":"Weighted completion at or above the planned curve.","source":"derived","state":"met","detail":"Weighted completion 52.74% against a planned 25%."},{"id":"g1.timeliness","gate":"G1","text":"Entry timeliness rate at or above 95% for the period.","source":"derived","state":"not_met","detail":"Entry Timeliness Rate 84.00% over 25 measurable entries is below the 95% target."},{"id":"g1.self_audit","gate":"G1","text":"All scheduled Tier 1 self audits performed, signed and on file.","source":"derived","state":"indeterminate","detail":"The Tier 1 self-audit schedule of §10 is not yet implemented in the application."},{"id":"g1.peer_audit","gate":"G1","text":"First Tier 2 peer audit performed, scored at 90 or above, with zero Critical findings.","source":"derived","state":"indeterminate","detail":"No Tier 2 peer audit is recorded for this book. The three-tier audit model of §10 is not yet implemented in the application."},{"id":"g1.registers","gate":"G1","text":"Controlled registers populated: welders, wrenches, heats, isometric drawings.","source":"derived","state":"met","detail":"Welders 4, wrenches 3, heats 3. The isometric drawing register is not yet modelled in the application, so that fourth register is the chair’s to confirm."},{"id":"g1.heats","gate":"G1","text":"Heat register reconciled. Every heat referenced by a weld has an MTR on file.","source":"derived","state":"met","detail":"All 3 heats referenced by welds have an MTR on file."},{"id":"g1.ncr","gate":"G1","text":"Zero open NCRs past due date.","source":"derived","state":"met","detail":"No open Critical or Major findings."}]', 52.74, 'Demo book. Entry timeliness below target for the period and two registers still incomplete; ten calendar days to clear, per §7.', '2026-09-28')
